<!-- step notes box -->
<mxCell id="steps" value="安全流程（编号对应连线）&#10;&#10;1. App 用现有 Token 调后端 (Bearer)&#10;2. 后端 verify_token → AccountId&#10;3. CreateFaceLivenessSession → SessionId&#10;4. 持久化绑定 AccountId↔AttemptId↔SessionId (state=CREATED)&#10;5. App 从 Identity Pool 取临时凭证&#10;6. App StartFaceLivenessSession (WebSocket 视频流)&#10;7. AWS 校验 IAM 权限 + SessionId 有效性；写参考图/审计图到 S3&#10;8. App 回调后端 (Token + attemptId + sessionId)&#10;9. 后端二次校验绑定 → GetFaceLivenessSessionResults → 1:N 查重 → 入库&#10;   → 状态机置 COMPLETED/FAILED（防重放）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="620" width="620" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

